Provides: gnome-screenshot
Replaces: gnome-screenshot
Conflicts: gnome-screenshot
Description: screenshot tool for the Cinnamon desktop
 Otto captures the entire screen, the active window, or a selected
 area, and offers a quick post-capture editor for cropping, rotating,
 and flipping the result before saving or copying to the clipboard.
 .
 Otto is a drop-in replacement for gnome-screenshot on Linux Mint and
 keeps its command-line interface compatible.
